{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 46, :comments ["<b>And she said, Drink.</b> This is the account of Eliezer, which he was recounting to the members of the household; and he should have said, ״ותאמר שתה אדני״ — 'And she said, Drink, my lord' — for so was the truth, and so she said to him at the beginning of her words; but in her father's house he did not wish to make this known, by way of modesty."], :book :genesis, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:14:48.901860489Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}